  "final_message": "Failed payments are now retried. The bug was in `due_for_retry` in `billing/dunning.py`.\n\nThe function filtered invoices with `status == \"opened\"`, but the real status value is `\"open\"`. No invoice ever matched, so nothing was ever picked up for retry. The invoice kept its past `next_attempt_at` and the subscription stayed `past_due`. I changed the filter to `\"open\"`.\n\nThe 24 existing tests pass. I didn't add a test that covers a declined card being retried.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` in the repository root:\n\n```json\n{\"file\": \"dunning.py\", \"function\": \"due_for_retry\"}\n```",
